OL,4,CToy shop owner 'heartbroken' after     
OL,5,CJellycat thefts                        
OL,6,GA toy shop owner has said she is       
OL,7,Gheartbroken after hundreds of pounds-  
OL,8,Gworth of stock was stolen from her     
OL,9,Gbusiness in the space of a few minutes.
OL,11,FBoos Toys in Poundbury, Dorchester,    
OL,12,Fposted a Facebook appeal after a group 
OL,13,Fof women and children appeared to help 
OL,14,Fthemselves to nearly #500-worth of     
OL,15,FJellycat toys.                         
OL,17,FFollowing the appeal, some of the      
OL,18,Fitems were returned. But, after        
OL,19,Freviewing CCTV, it emerged more stock  
OL,20,Fhad been taken than originally thought.
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
