OL,4,CMan arrested in unsolved 1989 murder   
OL,5,Cprobe                                  
OL,6,GA man has been arrested in connection  
OL,7,Gwith an unsolved murder that took      
OL,8,Gplace 37 years ago.                    
OL,10,FRichard Haywood, 36, known to many as  
OL,11,FRicky, was shot multiple times in his  
OL,12,Fflat above Ambiance Jewellers in       
OL,13,FShirley Road, Southampton, on 16       
OL,14,FOctober 1989.                          
OL,16,FDetectives reopened the murder         
OL,17,Finvestigation in 2024. Earlier,        
OL,18,FHampshire police officers carried out  
OL,19,Fsearches and enquiries in Peach Road   
OL,20,Fin the city.                           
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
