OL,4,CThree murder suspects bailed over      
OL,5,Cman's death                            
OL,6,GTwo men and a woman arrested on        
OL,7,Gsuspicion of murder following the      
OL,8,Gdeath of a man have been released on   
OL,9,Gpolice bail.                           
OL,11,FDorset Police said officers were sent  
OL,12,Fto Frances Road, Bournemouth on        
OL,13,FThursday at about 18:00 GMT after      
OL,14,Freports a man had been found injured   
OL,15,Fat an address. The 71-year-old man     
OL,16,Ffrom the town, was later confirmed     
OL,17,Fdead at the scene.                     
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
